    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Sandy C.",
        "date": "2025-11-30T22:25:51Z",
        "id": "692cd315e57a4f164cd29e5d",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Dec 5, 2025",
            "id": "da1d5deb-5d67-45a8-b650-683e0cff5c7f",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for sharing your experience with us. We’re glad the home felt comfortable, private and welcoming during your stay. It’s great to hear you enjoyed the easy walk to the beach and the nearby coffee shop. We appreciate your kind words about our team as well. It means a lot to know you felt supported from arrival to departure. We hope to welcome you back soon.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This home was beautiful. It was clean and we had no problems. Loved the experience. Benchmark Management gets 5 stars, too. They stay in touch with you from the time you get there until you leave. The 3 bedrooms on the second floor were very private. Loved the way they were spaced apart. Loved the short walk to the beach and a coffee shop across the street. Thank you owners for allowing us to stay there.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Kriste L.",
        "date": "2025-07-21T11:56:07Z",
        "id": "687e38fe2a124c3b8e4e0e02",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Aug 4, 2025",
            "id": "a8019a62-16d3-40e4-9fa1-5f647c7e7c47",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your wonderful review! We’re so glad you and your family enjoyed your stay and appreciate your understanding as we quickly addressed the issues. It was a pleasure hosting you, and we hope to welcome you back again soon.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We enjoyed our stay very much. There were a couple of issues, but were corrected quickly. Thank you for providing this property for our family.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Kelly F.",
        "date": "2026-01-08T21:48:57Z",
        "id": "69603464c6cfdc6b65866732",
        "label": "Okay",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 6,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jan 22, 2026",
            "id": "612fbca1-33df-4a2e-b9f2-2804958a1911",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for taking the time to share your feedback and for being a repeat guest Kelly; we truly appreciate your continued stays at this home.\n\nWe are sorry to hear that maintenance items and missing kitchen inventory impacted your most recent visit, especially during an off-season stay when more time is spent enjoying the home itself. Your comments regarding the glassware, dishwasher, broken tile, exterior wood, railing, and grill gas have been documented and shared with the proper parties so these items can be properly addressed. We agree that regular upkeep is essential to maintaining the comfort and quality our guests expect.\n\nWe also regret that the gas grill was unavailable on Christmas Day, as we understand how disappointing that must have been. Had we been notified during your stay, we would have gladly assisted where possible.\n\nThank you again for your honesty and loyalty to this property. Guest feedback like yours is invaluable in helping ensure the home continues to be well cared for, and we hope to have the opportunity to welcome you back in the future with these concerns resolved.\n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "House needs some maintenance. Overall clean but Kitchen lacking regular drinking glasses fine if we wanted to drink Margaritas the whole time, 4 matching wine glasses, maybe 2 drinking glasses,and other utensis lwere not available. Also broken tile in kitchen and bathrooms. Dishwasher not working properly could not move bottom rack as wheels are broken also sounds like a jet engine while running. Rotton wood around doors, outside railing about to fall over. No gas in gas grill which we discovered on Christmas day. We have stayed at this home 3 times and it is just time to do somethings around the house easy to over look when it is season and you are at the beach the whole time but when spending more time in the home during off season hard to overlook.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Terri B.",
        "date": "2023-06-02T18:35:31Z",
        "id": "647a3674ff1a0004fff61efd",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jul 12, 2023",
            "id": "f77f8c56-e71c-4348-ac86-a18316009da8",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Terri, \nWe are glad to hear you enjoyed your trip with us at Benchmark Management! We strive to provide our guests with the perfect property to spend their vacation at. So, we are thrilled to hear you thought this property was wonderful! We will certainly pass along your comments regarding the pool to the proper parties for review. We hope you consider Benchmark Management for all your upcoming trips to the beach; we would be glad to have you. Sincerely, Benchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
